I wake up in the morning.
I hear the loud sound of the rain.
Rain is continuously falling on the window of my apartment.
I look outside at the grey sky.
Today is my birthday.
Today I have turned thirty-two years old.
This is my first birthday far from Mexico.
I remember the month of January.
At that time, I arrived in Mumbai.
At that time, the city was completely dry.
I came here only for a job.
Now the monsoon has changed the whole city.
The rain has filled the streets with water.
I have bought a good umbrella and a raincoat.
I like this rainy season very much.
Today a new year begins in my life.
